  "prompt": "Split the campaigns of each channel into two halves by their spend from 1 July to 31 October 2025, both days included: half 1 holds the campaigns that spent the most. spend_date is a UTC day, a campaign's spend is the sum of its spend in ad_spend_daily over those days, and only campaigns with rows in that period count. When a channel has an odd number of such campaigns, half 1 holds one more. When campaigns of a channel tie on spend, the lower campaign_id comes first. Return four columns, in this order: channel_id, campaign_id, spend and spend_half. Return one row for each such campaign. Any row order is fine.",
